{
  "action": "After a standard system update you need to reboot your computer to make all\nthe necessary changes.",
  "cves": [
    "CVE-2026-7867"
  ],
  "description": "It was discovered that UDisks did not correctly validate the caller\nidentity when handling the as-user option in the\norg.freedesktop.UDisks2.Filesystem.Mount() D-Bus method. A local attacker\nwith an active console session could possibly use this issue to mount\nfilesystems on behalf of arbitrary users, including privileged accounts,\nleading to local privilege escalation.",
  "id": "USN-8701-1",
  "isummary": "UDisks could be made to run programs as an administrator.",
